          <p>
            Every model on this list uses LFP (lithium iron phosphate) cells, which tolerate thousands of charge cycles and age more gracefully in storage than the NMC packs in Jackery's older Explorer models. Specs here come from Jackery's published figures rather than our own measurements, and we round where Jackery rounds. Weights are approximate and vary slightly between listings.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you are still choosing a brand, our <a href="/best-portable-power-station/">portable power station rankings</a> compare Jackery against EcoFlow, Anker SOLIX and Bluetti, and our <a href="/ecoflow-vs-jackery/">EcoFlow vs Jackery</a> comparison goes size class by size class. This page assumes you have settled on Jackery and want the right Explorer.
          </p>
